The time window
LoadFromHistory() selects the whole history, not the dates the user asks for. A trade opened before the start date still needs its entry deal, for the magic and for the commission. A trade that was partly closed before the end date and closed for good after it needs its later exits too. Without them, the partial result would look like a finished trade.
